  "item": [
    {
      "id": "a98ad759-fee0-493b-ad72-a26d2adfc211",
      "name": "Coupon Category",
      "description": {
        "content": "<!-- markdownlint-disable MD041 MD051 github-internal-links relative-links -- tag description snippet, not a standalone document; the tag name serves as the heading in the API docs -->\nCoupon categories let you group coupons under a shared label. The category has no effect on coupon behaviour or tax treatment.\n\nTo assign a coupon to a category, set `couponCategory_id` when [creating](#operation/couponCreate) or [updating](#operation/couponUpdateById) the coupon. You cannot delete a category that still has coupons assigned to it.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
